                                                "sense_id": "e4d8b049-7635-3984-a04f-296fc8916685",
                                                "text": "In a show of Sarajevan defiance or perhaps simply out of habit, old men in flat caps are playing giant chess in the tree-lined square outside the Orthodox cathedral, quite as if they’re not in danger, just as they do every afternoon."
